(7415776, 1169804, 100393, '<td valign="top">Amazing judgement in the luminosity of the body; I love how it can just, and only just, be seen.</td>', 'Amazing judgement in the luminosity of the body; I love how it can just, and only just, be seen.', '2015-11-11 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415849, 1169833, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d like a closer crop. Such a great pose and lighting, I''d tighten the focus on the face.</td>', 'I''d like a closer crop. Such a great pose and lighting, I''d tighten the focus on the face.', '2015-11-12 03:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415850, 1169673, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nicely done on the eyes, but consider cloning out the building behind the cats head. It is distracting and is in a horrible spot. Either clone or change angle of shot to get a cleaner background.</td>', 'Nicely done on the eyes, but consider cloning out the building behind the cats head. It is distracting and is in a horrible spot. Either clone or change angle of shot to get a cleaner background.', '2015-11-12 03:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415851, 1169448, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but the blur in the shot seems strange. The jaw is in focus but the entire top snout is not other than whiskers... I''m assuming this blur was introduced in PP, and it isn''t consistent. Beyond that, really like the shot.</td>', 'I really like the shot, but the blur in the shot seems strange. The jaw is in focus but the entire top snout is not other than whiskers... I''m assuming this blur was introduced in PP, and it isn''t consistent. Beyond that, really like the shot.', '2015-11-12 03:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415852, 1169533, 93565, '<td valign="top">The crop is rather awkward, as it is not a particularly photogenic perspective as it makes your dog look much longer than it is. Try to get lower, so you are looking your dog face to face, it will create a much better perspective. Also, looks like there was a bit of difficulty obtaining focus, as your camera has focused on the leaves/scene behind the dog. Work on your composition/camera operation and this could be improved a lot.<br/>This isn''t a perfect example, but it shows how much livelier your dog can seem if you get lower to shoot the photo. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1106098" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1895/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1106098.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1895/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1106098.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1895/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1106098.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The crop is rather awkward, as it is not a particularly photogenic perspective as it makes your dog look much longer than it is. Try to get lower, so you are looking your dog face to face, it will create a much better perspective. Also, looks like there was a bit of difficulty obtaining focus, as your camera has focused on the leaves/scene behind the dog. Work on your composition/camera operation and this could be improved a lot.This isn''t a perfect example, but it shows how much livelier your dog can seem if you get lower to shoot the photo. ', '2015-11-12 03:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415854, 1169832, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nicely done portrait. The tones and lighting are great. I''d like to see more eye engagement, but this is very nice.</td>', 'Nicely done portrait. The tones and lighting are great. I''d like to see more eye engagement, but this is very nice.', '2015-11-12 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415855, 1169539, 93565, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but could use some WB work, as the WB makes the dog seem blue in places and doesn''t seem natural.</td>', 'A nice shot, but could use some WB work, as the WB makes the dog seem blue in places and doesn''t seem natural.', '2015-11-12 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415856, 1169660, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but lighting focuses attention on the human in this, not the pets, so this is a portrait of a pet owner, not a pet.</td>', 'Nice shot, but lighting focuses attention on the human in this, not the pets, so this is a portrait of a pet owner, not a pet.', '2015-11-12 03:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415857, 1169608, 93565, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and edit. Looks like a bit of light could''ve been used on the right instead of pushing in post, but this is a great, expressive pet shot. The dogs neck photo right seems to be a bit oddly colored, same with the fur on the dog''s left front leg. Regardless, this is the best shot in the challenge. Bumped to 9.</td>', 'Love the pose and edit. Looks like a bit of light could''ve been used on the right instead of pushing in post, but this is a great, expressive pet shot. The dogs neck photo right seems to be a bit oddly colored, same with the fur on the dog''s left front leg. Regardless, this is the best shot in the challenge. Bumped to 9.', '2015-11-12 03:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415858, 1169587, 93565, '<td valign="top">The detail is excellent, the fish appears almost fake. Bumped to 8.</td>', 'The detail is excellent, the fish appears almost fake. Bumped to 8.', '2015-11-12 03:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415859, 1169533, 6519, '<td valign="top">It would help a LOT if the focus was on his/her eyes instead of on the collar.</td>', 'It would help a LOT if the focus was on his/her eyes instead of on the collar.', '2015-11-12 04:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7415860, 1169631, 6519, '<td valign="top">Usually we like to have the best focus on the eyes, instead of on the tip of a nose. But I do like your "fill the frame" approach.</td>', 'Usually we like to have the best focus on the eyes, instead of on the tip of a nose. But I do like your "fill the frame" approach.', '2015-11-12 04:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
