(7416069, 1169614, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It seems really playful and unique and I like the balance of the background colors against the white bird.</td>', 'I love this.  It seems really playful and unique and I like the balance of the background colors against the white bird.', '2015-11-13 13:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
