(7416645, 1169660, 38032, '<td valign="top">Strong on a few levels. Cute pups. Great light and tones. Kinda funny. The composition is lacking in drama and the connection between the dogs and the camera and model could be stronger. 8 Voted earlier.</td>', 'Strong on a few levels. Cute pups. Great light and tones. Kinda funny. The composition is lacking in drama and the connection between the dogs and the camera and model could be stronger. 8 Voted earlier.', '2015-11-16 16:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
